⚡️🇺🇸 Anduril Industries has signed a Moratorium of Understanding (MoU) with Sparrows’ Point Yard, the historical shipyard in Maryland, USA that was once home to Bethlehem Steel.

The 3,300 acre (1,335.46ha) site was selected by Anduril for the building of “potentially hundreds” of unmanned surface vessels.

